@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Strategy runtime collaboration
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

actor Caller
participant "handler : Context" as H
participant "policy : ExactSelectionPolicy" as P
participant "resolver : ConcreteStrategy" as S
Caller -> H : exact requested kind / language / revision
H -> P : validate current eligibility and select
P --> H : eligible strategy or refusal
alt eligible
 H -> S : resolve(exact selection)
 S --> H : actual representation or unavailable / unknown
 H --> Caller : permitted truthful projection
else invalid / denied / unavailable
 H --> Caller : safe bounded refusal; no substitution
end

@enduml
